                },
                "body": {
                  "en": "7-Eleven (Cambridge St, near Charles Circle) is open 24 hours for snacks and basics. Beacon Hill Market (Charles St) is a late-night grocery until midnight. South Station food court (~15 min via Red Line) has several 24-hour spots if you need a change of scene.",
